  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementation of the EU EOM to Nigeria 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is the implementation of logistics, security, financial and administrative aspects of the 2023 EU EOM to Nigeria, for the Federal Level Elections, scheduled for the 25th of February 2023 and the State Level Elections scheduled for the 11th of March 2023. IOM will select of team of experts (Project Manager, Logistics Expert, Security Expert and Deputy, IT Expert, Finance &amp; Contract Expert, six Liaison Officers) who will be deployed to Abuja from end of December 2022 to end of April 2023 to implement the mission. The EOM will be composed by a Chief Observer, a Core Team of 11 members and 40 Long Term Observers. IOM will have no visibility in the project.</narrative>
  </description>
